00\u0000Host: %s (%s)\tStatus: Unknown\r\n\u0000\u0000Nmap scan report for %s [host down\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Other addresses for %s (not scanned):\u0000\u0000\u0000virtual const char* FingerPrintResultsIPv6::merge_fpr(const Target*, bool, bool) const\u0000\u0000std::string get_scrubbed_buffer(const FPResponse*)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000resp->len == (unsigned int) len1\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000resp->len == (unsigned int) len2\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Nmap done at %s; %u %s (%u %s up) scanned in %.2f seconds\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Warning: OSScan results may be unreliable because we could not find at least 1 open and 1 closed port\r\n\u0000\u0000buffer 0verfl0w of familygenerations\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Nmap needs more fingerprint submissions of this type. Please submit via https://nmap.org/submit/\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000OS fingerprint not ideal because: %s\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000No exact OS matches for host (If you know what OS is running on it, see https://nmap.org/submit/ ).\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Aggressive OS guesses: %s (%.f%%)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000No exact OS matches for host (test conditions non-ideal).\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000No OS matches for host (If you know what OS is running on it, see https://nmap.org/submit/ ).\r\n\u0000\u0000Too many fingerprints match this host to give specific OS details\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000void printosscanoutput(Target*)\u0000Uptime guess: %.3f days (since %s)\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000STRANGE ERROR #3877 -- please report to fyodor@nmap.org\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000TCP Sequence Prediction: Difficulty=%d (%s)\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000STRANGE ERROR #3876 -- please report to fyodor@nmap.org\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000IP ID Sequence Generation: %s\r\n\u0000\u0000STRANGE ERROR #3878 -- please report to fyodor@nmap.o