[53.475481, "o", " %s\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000%s called with woefully inadequate parameters\u0000\u0000\u0000Raw packets sent: %llu (%s) | Rcvd: %llu (%s)\u0000\u0000\u0000Packet tracer: ND packets must be at least %lu bytes long (is %lu).\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Packet tracer: tiny packet encountered\u0000\u0000int send_ip_packet(int, const eth_nfo*, const sockaddr_storage*, const u8*, unsigned int)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000int send_ipv4_packet(int, const eth_nfo*, const sockaddr_in*, const u8*, unsigned int)\u0000\u0000%s only understands IP versions 4 and 6 (got %u)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000void TracerouteState::send_new_probes()\u0000void TracerouteState::next_active_host()\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000next_sending_host != active_hosts.end()\u0000u8* build_ip_raw(const in_addr*, const in_addr*, u8, int, u16, u8, bool, const u8*, int, const char*, u16, u32*)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Unknown icmp type/code (%d/%d) in %s\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000virtual unsigned char* ICMPProbe::build_packet(const sockaddr_storage*, u32*) const\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000u8* build_ipv6_raw(const in6_addr*, const in6_addr*, u8, u32, u8, int, const char*, u16, u32*)\u0000\u0000%s called with an option length argument of %d which is illegal because it is not divisible by 4. Just add \\0 padding to the end.\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Unknown address family %u in %s.\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000virtual unsigned char* ICMPv6Probe::build_packet(const sockaddr_storage*, u32*) const\u0000\u0000\u0000NULL packet device passed to %s\u0000WARNING: Negative timeout value (%lu) passed to %s() -- using 0\u0000Cannot obtain datalink information: %s\u0000\u0000FATAL: %s: bogus caplen from libpcap (%d) on interface type %d\u0000\u0000FATAL:  Unknown datalink type (%d). Caplen: %d; Packet:\u0000Rejecting tiny, supposed IP packet (size %u)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Rejecting IP packet because of invalid length\u0000\u0000\u0000Rejecting IP fragment (offset %u)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Rejecting IP packet because of invalid version number %u\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Rejecting TCP packet because of incomplete header\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Rejecting TCP packet because of bad TCP header\u0000\u0000Rejecting UDP packet because of incomplete header\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000char* readip_pcap(pcap_t*, unsigned int*, long int, timeval*, link_header*, bool)\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000 while inserting %s at TTL %d for %s\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000Traceroute probe to %s TTL %d timed out\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Set hop %s TTL %d to %s RTT %.2f ms\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Traceroute cache hit %s TTL %d while tracing\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000%s continuing trace from TTL %d\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000%s: Failed to determine nextHop to target\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000%s Timing: About %.2f%% done; ETC: %02d:%02d (%.f:%02.f:%02.f remaining)\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Timing error: localtime(%f) is NULL\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000%s Timing: About %.2f%% done; ETC: Unknown (%.f:%02.f:%02.f remaining)\r\n\u0000bool ScanProgressMeter::printStatsIfNecessary(double, const timeval*)\u0000\u0000\u0000Completed %s at %02d:%02d, %.2fs elapsed\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000TracerouteState::TracerouteState(std::vector<Target*>&)\u0000Target* next_target(HostGroupState*, const addrset*, scan_lists*, int)\u0000\u0000%s: failed to determine route to %s\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000%s: Failed to determine dst MAC address for target %s\u0000\u0000\u0000Timeout vals: srtt: %d rttvar: %d to: %d \u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Small negative delta (probably due to libpcap time / gettimeofday() discrepancy) - adjusting from %lius to %dus\r\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00